    <comp lib="9" loc="(1336,655)" name="Text">
      <a name="text">IMPLEMENTATION COMPARISON

UNSIMPLIFIED:
F = X'Y'Z' + X'Y'Z + XY'Z + XYZ

SIMPLIFIED:
F = X'Y' + XZ

VERIFICATION:
All 8 input combinations produce identical outputs.
Therefore, both implementations are logically equivalent.</a>
