    <comp lib="9" loc="(805,89)" name="Text">
      <a name="text">LAB 02 — BOOLEAN EXPRESSION TO LOGIC CIRCUIT

Function:
F(X,Y,Z) = Σm(0,1,5,7)

Objective:
Implement the unsimplified SOP form,
verify it using the truth table,
then compare it with the K-map simplified implementation.</a>
    </comp>
